{
  "info": {
    "name": "Cristo Rei - Etiquetas Shopee (Java 21 / Quarkus)",
    "description": "Fluxo de conferencia antes de gerar o ZPL. Importe esta collection no Postman, selecione o arquivo no request 1 e use a variavel loteId capturada automaticamente.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "loteId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "numero",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 - Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/lotes/health",
        "description": "Confere se o Quarkus esta respondendo (HTTP 200)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"API responde\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"UP\"); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 - Enviar TXT e analisar etiquetas",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/lotes",
        "description": "Body -> form-data, campo arquivo do tipo File: selecione o TXT da Shopee com etiquetas e checklists alternados. Salva o id retornado como loteId.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "arquivo",
              "type": "file",
              "src": "",
              "description": "Selecione o .txt local no Postman"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Criou lote\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  const lote = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(lote.id).to.be.a('string');",
              "  pm.expect(lote.total).to.be.above(0);",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('loteId', lote.id);",
              "  console.log('Lote', lote.id, 'etiquetas:', lote.total);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 - Consultar lote",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/lotes/{{loteId}}",
        "description": "Obtem JSON completo com numeros, descricoes, status e avisos."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Lote retornado\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 - Listar pendencias",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/lotes/{{loteId}}/pendencias",
        "description": "Mostra somente as linhas com status REVISAR. Confira antes de qualquer correcao."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Pendencias retornadas\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) console.log('Pendencias:', pm.response.json().quantidadePendencias);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 - Corrigir descricao de UMA etiqueta",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/lotes/{{loteId}}/etiquetas/{{numero}}",
        "description": "Antes de enviar, ajuste a variavel numero para a etiqueta correta e confirme a descricao pelo checklist. ATENCAO: a correcao manual marca a linha como corrigida.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"descricao\": \"1x Mini Rosa\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Descricao alterada\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5 - Baixar ZPL final",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/lotes/{{loteId}}/impressao",
        "description": "Quando nao houver REVISAR, utilize Send and Download no Postman para salvar o .zpl. HTTP 409 significa pendencia nao resolvida."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Resposta de download ou pendencia\", () => pm.expect([200,409]).to.include(pm.response.code));",
              "if (pm.response.code === 409) console.warn(pm.response.json().erro);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
